- Time Estimate: {!$Input:WorkOrder.Duration} {!$Input:WorkOrder.DurationType}

II. Preparation & Safety
- Critical Risk Checklist:{!$Input:WorkOrder.High_Risk_Codes__c}
- Required Safety Forms: {!$RelatedList:WorkOrder.DynamicDataCaptures.Records}
- Safety Notes/Prereqs: {!$Input:WorkOrder.Supervisor_Notes__c}

III. Logistics & Materials
