- Operations: summarise the list of operations  {!$RelatedList:WorkOrder.WorkOrderLineItems.Records}

IV. Execution Steps (Digital Checklist)
- Step 1: {{#if (contains {!$Input:WorkOrder.High_Risk_Codes__c} "Isolation")}}Confirm Isolation Point and Lock-On.{{else}}If safety/isolation prerequisites are indicated, confirm isolation/permit requirements before work.{{/if}}
- Steps 2..N: If {!$RelatedList:WorkOrder.WorkSteps.Records} is present, transform into 3–6 concise, verifiable steps. Otherwise, generate 3–6 steps grounded strictly in Description/Work Type without adding new tools/parts not provided.
